@startuml SQ09_View_Customer_List
title UC32 - View Customer List Sequence Diagram
autonumber "1:"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ActorFontColor #000000
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    GroupBorderColor #000000
}

actor "Pharmacist" as Pharmacist #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nCustomerListPage" as CustomerListPage #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nCustomerController" as CustomerController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nCustomerServiceImpl" as CustomerServiceImpl #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nCustomerRepository" as CustomerRepository #7ACFF5
database "<<entity>>\nSQL Server (PMS DB)" as DB #7ACFF5

activate Pharmacist #7ACFF5
== Phase 1: Load Initial Customer List ==
Pharmacist -> CustomerListPage: Navigate to Customer Directory (/customers)
activate CustomerListPage #7ACFF5

CustomerListPage -> CustomerController: GET /api/v1/customers?page=0&size=10&sortBy=id&sortDir=desc (Bearer AT)
activate CustomerController #7ACFF5

CustomerController -> CustomerServiceImpl: getCustomers(keyword="", status=null, 0, 10, "id", "desc")
activate CustomerServiceImpl #7ACFF5

CustomerServiceImpl -> CustomerRepository: findWithFilter(keyword, status, Pageable)
activate CustomerRepository #7ACFF5

CustomerRepository -> DB: SELECT c FROM customers c WHERE c.status=1 ORDER BY c.id DESC OFFSET 0 ROWS FETCH NEXT 10 ROWS
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> CustomerRepository: Page<Customer> + TotalElements
deactivate DB

CustomerRepository --> CustomerServiceImpl: Page<Customer>
deactivate CustomerRepository

CustomerServiceImpl --> CustomerController: PageResponse<CustomerResponse> (content, totalElements, totalPages)
deactivate CustomerServiceImpl

CustomerController --> CustomerListPage: HTTP 200 OK + PageResponse
deactivate CustomerController

CustomerListPage --> Pharmacist: Render customer table with pagination

== Phase 2: Live Search by Customer Phone/Name ==
Pharmacist -> CustomerListPage: Type phone "0987123456" into search input
CustomerListPage -> CustomerListPage: Debounce timer 300ms

CustomerListPage -> CustomerController: GET /api/v1/customers?keyword=0987123456&page=0&size=10
activate CustomerController #7ACFF5

CustomerController -> CustomerServiceImpl: getCustomers("0987123456", null, 0, 10, "id", "desc")
activate CustomerServiceImpl #7ACFF5

CustomerServiceImpl -> CustomerRepository: findWithFilter("0987123456", null, Pageable)
activate CustomerRepository #7ACFF5

CustomerRepository -> DB: SELECT c FROM customers c WHERE (c.phone LIKE '%0987123456%' OR c.fullName LIKE '%0987123456%')
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> CustomerRepository: Filtered Page<Customer>
deactivate DB

CustomerRepository --> CustomerServiceImpl: Page<Customer>
deactivate CustomerRepository

CustomerServiceImpl --> CustomerController: PageResponse<CustomerResponse>
deactivate CustomerServiceImpl

CustomerController --> CustomerListPage: HTTP 200 OK + Filtered PageResponse
deactivate CustomerController

CustomerListPage --> Pharmacist: Re-render customer table with matching records
deactivate CustomerListPage
deactivate Pharmacist
@enduml